  {
   "key": "u26438",
   "en": "The drivers for your monitor have not been installed.  Your monitor may not support all of the video options presented to you. You can permanently damage your monitor by selecting a video option that your monitor does not support. You must install a proper monitor driver to correct this problem. Please see your hardware vendor's website for further information on obtaining the required monitor drivers.",
